#: ../../tools/ensembl_phenotype_tools.rst:32 c1d2cf5a553f44a2a9dcbfae5f2dca87
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get phenotype associations for a gene from the Ensembl "
"REST API. Returns diseases, traits, and clinical conditions linked to the"
" gene, aggregated from multiple sources including Cancer Gene Census, "
"OMIM, ClinVar, NHGRI-EBI GWAS catalog, and Orphanet. Each entry includes "
"the phenotype description, data source, genomic location, and ontology "
"accessions (EFO, HP, Orphanet). Example: BRCA1 returns 162 phenotype "
"associations across multiple cancer types and other conditions."
msgstr ""

